      "job_title": "Sr Data Analyst Indore (India)",
      "description": "Lumenore is looking for Sr. Data Analyst to join our energetic team and embark on a rewarding career journey. As a Senior Data Analyst, your role is to gather, analyze, and interpret complex data to provide valuable insights and support data-driven decision-making within an organization. You work with large datasets, employ statistical techniques, and use various tools and technologies to extract meaningful information.   \n\nHere are some key responsibilities and tasks typically associated with the role of a Senior Data Analyst:Data Collection and Exploration: Collecting and organizing data from various sources, such as databases, data warehouses, APIs, or external sources.   \n\nYou explore and understand the data, identify data quality issues, and ensure data integrity.Data Analysis and Modeling: Applying statistical analysis, data mining techniques, and advanced analytical methods to extract insights from data. You develop models and algorithms to uncover patterns, correlations, and trends, and generate actionable recommendations based on your findings.Data Visualization and Reporting: Creating visualizations, dashboards, and reports to present data analysis results in a transparent and compelling manner.   \n\nYou use tools like Tableau, Power BI, or Python libraries like Matplotlib and Seaborn to visually communicate complex data to stakeholders.Business Intelligence and Decision Support: Collaborating with business stakeholders to understand their requirements and translate them into data analysis projects.   \n\nYou provide analytical support to decision-making processes, helping stakeholders make informed and data-driven decisions.Data Quality and Governance: Ensuring data accuracy, consistency, and compliance with data governance policies. You validate and cleanse data, establish data quality standards, and implement data governance frameworks to maintain data integrity.   \n\nDisclaimer : This job posting has been aggregated from external source. Role details, content, and availability are subject to change. Applicants are advised to confirm the latest information directly on the company website before applying. .",
